OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere'll be
OL,6,Fwarm sunshine to end the day, and
OL,7,Fclear periods are then likely this
OL,8,Fevening. However, patchy cloud will
OL,9,Fgradually edge in from the northwest
OL,10,Fovernight. Light winds overnight and
OL,11,Fremaining mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FSome early bright spells,
OL,14,Fbut cloud will continue to feed across
OL,15,Fthe region on Thursday morning, with
OL,16,Fthe small chance of a shower
OL,17,Fdeveloping. Sunshine returning later,
OL,18,Fbut feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
